<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="546730054"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1799629065"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Light Delight"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Poppin'Party"/><amll:meta key="album" value="CiRCLING"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:09.667"><div begin="00:27.566" end="04:44.613"><p begin="00:27.566" end="00:32.857" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">ため息色 染まる天井<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">独自躺在床上仰望</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta me iki ilo so ma lu ten jiyou</span></p><p begin="00:32.857" end="00:38.206" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">一人ぼっちのベッドから見上げ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被叹息所渲染的天花板</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hito li bo qi no be do ka la mi a ge</span></p><p begin="00:38.206" end="00:43.559" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">声をだせず 前を向けず<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沉默不语 停滞不前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">koe wo da se zu mae wo mu ke zu</span></p><p begin="00:43.559" end="00:48.418" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">ふがいのない 涙がこぼれる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没出息的泪水滑落脸颊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ga i no na i namida ga ko bo re lu</span></p><p begin="00:48.418" end="00:54.762" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">何も聞こえないほど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好似什么也听不到一般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">nani mo ki ko e na i ho do</span></p><p begin="00:54.762" end="00:58.745" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">耳ふさいだ(だけど)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然堵上了耳朵</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mimi fu sa i da da ke do</span></p><p begin="00:58.745" end="01:08.126" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">明日になればすべてがなかったように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可到了明天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a xita ni na re ba</span></p><p begin="01:08.126" end="01:15.082" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">笑顔で唄うよ だから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为要带着笑容歌唱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e gao de wuta wu yo da ka la</span></p><p begin="01:15.082" end="01:17.782" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">泣いて泣いて泣いて泣いて(自分を)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以哭吧哭吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na i te na i te na i te na i te</span></p><p begin="01:17.782" end="01:20.334" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">抱いて抱いて抱いて抱いて(抱きしめ)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i te da i te da i te da i te</span></p><p begin="01:20.334" end="01:22.359" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Search for the light delight!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧紧怀抱吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Search for the light delight</span></p><p begin="01:22.359" end="01:25.681" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">取り戻そうとした(声が)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快要恢复的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to li modo so u to xi ta koe ga</span></p><p begin="01:25.681" end="01:28.316" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Song for the light delight!(叫ぶよ)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Song for the light delight！(叫喊吧)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Song for the light delight</span></p><p begin="01:28.316" end="01:30.410" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Song for the light delight!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在呐喊啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Song for the light delight</span></p><p begin="01:30.410" end="01:37.459" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">ひとつだけ(キミと)約束をしたいんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只想与你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to cu da ke ki mi to</span></p><p begin="01:37.459" end="01:44.481" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">まずは私が勇気だすから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">首先我要拿出勇气</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma zu wa wataxi ga yuu ki da su ka la</span></p><p begin="01:58.228" end="02:03.555" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">「おはよう」から始まる朝<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从早上好开始一天的早晨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o ha yo u ka la haji ma lu asa</span></p><p begin="02:03.555" end="02:08.885" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">ありふれた物語が続く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">平凡的故事在继续</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a li fu re ta mono gatali ga cuzu ku</span></p><p begin="02:08.885" end="02:14.199" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">励ましたり 叱られたり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或是激励 或是遭到斥责</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hage ma xi ta li xika la re ta li</span></p><p begin="02:14.199" end="02:19.065" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">微笑んだり 笑わせあったり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或是微笑 或是彼此互逗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hoho e n da li wala wa se a ta li</span></p><p begin="02:19.065" end="02:25.402" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">一人きりじゃないんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">并非孤单一人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hito li ki li ji a na i n da</span></p><p begin="02:25.402" end="02:29.399" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">空見上げて(思う)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仰望天空细心思考</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sola mi a ge te omo wu</span></p><p begin="02:29.399" end="02:38.686" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">孤独なふりをするのはもうやめよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再也不会</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko doku na fu li wo su lu no wa</span></p><p begin="02:38.686" end="02:45.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">笑顔で唄うよ だから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为要带着笑容歌唱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e gao de wuta wu yo da ka la</span></p><p begin="02:45.730" end="02:48.379" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">泣いて泣いて泣いて泣いて(朝まで)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以哭吧哭吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na i te na i te na i te na i te</span></p><p begin="02:48.379" end="02:50.961" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">抱いて抱いて抱いて抱いて(全てを)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到早晨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i te da i te da i te da i te</span></p><p begin="02:50.961" end="02:52.949" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">Search for the light delight!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将一切都怀抱吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sube te wo</span></p><p begin="02:52.949" end="02:56.296" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">孤独にとらわれて(いても)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算被孤独所萦绕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko doku ni to la wa re te i te mo</span></p><p begin="02:56.296" end="02:59.029" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Song for the light delight!(明日は)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Song for the light delight！(明日)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Song for the light delight</span></p><p begin="02:59.029" end="03:01.034" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Song for the light delight!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Song for the light delight</span></p><p begin="03:01.034" end="03:08.131" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">つらいこと(キミに)素直にうちあけよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将那难以言说的心情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">cu la i ko to ki mi ni</span></p><p begin="03:08.131" end="03:15.246" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">まずは私が変わらなければ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">首先我必须要做出改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma zu wa wataxi ga ka wa la na ke re ba</span></p><p begin="03:35.729" end="03:41.109" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">「大丈夫だよ 一人じゃないよ」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没关系的 我并非孤单一人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">dai jiyou bu da yo hito li ji a na i yo</span></p><p begin="03:41.109" end="03:46.422" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">「あきらめないで もう少しだけ！」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要放弃 只要能再多在一起一点</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ki la me na i de mo u suko xi da ke</span></p><p begin="03:46.422" end="03:51.739" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">「一緒にいれば 素直になれる！」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就能坦率起来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i xiyo ni i re ba su nao ni na re lu</span></p><p begin="03:51.739" end="04:03.735" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">「自分のこと好きになれるよ だから」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就能喜欢上自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji bun no ko to su ki ni na re lu yo</span></p><p begin="04:04.295" end="04:07.015" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">泣いて泣いて泣いて泣いて(一緒に)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哭吧哭吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na i te na i te na i te na i te</span></p><p begin="04:07.015" end="04:09.721" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">泣いて泣いて泣いて泣いて(一緒に)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na i te na i te na i te na i te</span></p><p begin="04:09.721" end="04:11.775" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">こんなふうにきっとずっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na fu u ni ki to zu to</span></p><p begin="04:11.775" end="04:15.068" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">一番そばにいて(ほしい)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多希望你永远在我身旁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">iqi ban so ba ni i te ho xi i</span></p><p begin="04:15.068" end="04:17.752" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">Search for the light delight!(一緒に！)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Search for the light delight！(大家一起！)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Search for the light delight</span></p><p begin="04:17.752" end="04:19.693" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">Search for the light delight!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Search for the light delight</span></p><p begin="04:19.693" end="04:26.761" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">生きていく(キミに)信じてほしいことを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此活下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki te i ku ki mi ni</span></p><p begin="04:26.761" end="04:32.103" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">まずは私が信じる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">首先我要自己相信</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma zu wa wataxi ga xin ji lu</span></p><p begin="04:32.103" end="04:39.225" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">この世界は一人じゃないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这个世上我并非孤单一人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no se kai wa hito li ji a na i yo</span></p><p begin="04:40.011" end="04:44.613" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">一人じゃないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">并非孤单一人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hito li ji a na i yo</span></p></div></body></tt>